# the one tracked weight -- see research/vision/RUN_YOLO.md
#
# `research/models/` as a directory rule would stop git descending into it at
# all, so the negation below could never be seen. `/*` excludes the CONTENTS
# and leaves the directory visible. Everything else there stays ignored: the
# yolov8n/s-seg base weights are re-downloaded by train.py on demand, and
# only this one file cannot be got back any other way.
research/models/*
!research/models/lane_seg_synth_cpu.pt
